      "sourceTextSha256": "6a5f958c9d1d6837925457d131f9eda7eeec99194ad379e456339a3b6bc44ae9",
      "text": "Day 6 · Argentine side of the falls – Buenos Aires. After breakfast, cross the Tancredo Neves Bridge over the Iguaçu River into the Argentine national park, whose paths, elevated walkways and observation platforms bring you remarkably close to the falls, the source of the cascades and the legendary Devil’s Throat, the most impressive of all, in a park of some 55,500 hectares. After the excursion, transfer to the airport for your flight to Buenos Aires, where a driver meets you for the transfer to your hotel.",
